  <p id="c-nanshi-060-yinjun-yuansu-family:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-060-yinjun-yuansu-family:p001:m0000" ref="9ac_ddl_9iz">元素</persName>娶尚書僕射琅邪<persName id="c-nanshi-060-yinjun-yuansu-family:p001:m0009" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn">王僧朗</persName>女，生子<persName id="c-nanshi-060-yinjun-yuansu-family:p001:m0016" ref="9ac_ddl_9iz_A">寧</persName>早卒，<persName id="c-nanshi-060-yinjun-yuansu-family:p001:m0020" ref="9ac_ddl_9iz_A">寧</persName>遺腹生子<persName id="c-nanshi-060-yinjun-yuansu-family:p001:m0025" ref="ceq_pnr_q0e">叡</persName>，亦當從戮，<persName id="c-nanshi-060-yinjun-yuansu-family:p001:m0032" ref="q7m_r8k_2vn">僧朗</persName>啟孝武救之得免。</p>
